  "verifiedBehaviors": [
    "Real AVPlayerItem audioMix/MTAudioProcessingTap processes decoded imported WAV and a genuine locally seeded MP3 cache record.",
    "Local 910 Hz versus 6000 Hz WAV output/input energy ratio comparison exceeds 2.5; these are assertions on actual tap PCM measurements.",
    "Cached MP3 preamp output/input RMS equals 10^(-6/20) within 0.025; input RMS exceeds 0.01 and processed frames exceed 3000.",
    "Settings have a bounded lock-free C mailbox. No allocation, logging, I/O, actor hop or blocking call is introduced in the process callback.",
    "Paused settings never resume AVPlayer. New settings during asynchronous per-item metadata/tap setup do not replace the chosen source. Pending seek survives pause/resume.",
    "Effects revisions and acknowledgements retain their accepted client/request independently of transport handshakes; stale or future effects owners are rejected.",
    "Original five runtime methods pass on both families: import/AVAsset/private copy, transport, mixed queue/duplicate ended, deleted-local refusal and real HTTPS WebKit bridge.",
    "Production AppShell WKWebView is attached to a real UIWindow/scene. Actual public PWA viewport overflow and a visible control at least 24 by 24 are checked; screenshots are XCTest attachments."
  ],
