  "limitations": [
    "Simulator results are not physical iPhone/iPad, lock-screen/background endurance, route-change or audible-fidelity evidence.",
    "The seeded cache MP3 test is not proof of an authenticated provider download. No HLS/FairPlay, WebView provider DSP or restricted-source bypass is claimed.",
    "Only EQ/preamp are implemented natively; echo, reverb, LUFS normalization and independent pitch remain unsupported and are advertised false.",
